      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Vein Steam Pyrolyzer is a 7x7x7 tower that plugs straight into the underground oil system: on first run it locks onto the fluid beneath its chunk, then scans neighbors for the same fluid. Every completed cycle — 360s bronze / 180s steel — it injects +10,000mB / +25,000mB into every matched chunk's reservoir. Oil fields that refill themselves.\n\nRange chips widen the scan: T1 turns 1 chunk into a 2x2, T2 a 4x4, T3 an 8x8 — costing 16 / 32 / 64 singularities up the chain. Steam: 1,000 L/s bronze, 4,000 L/s steel.\n\nA T3 pyrolyzer blankets a small ocean of oil chunks. Feed your ammonia plant forever.",
